/* Info tips */
"Extended creates a separate virtual monitor. Mirror duplicates your main display." = "扩展会创建一个独立的虚拟显示器。镜像会复制你的主显示器画面。";
"Resolution of the virtual display. Higher resolutions use more bandwidth." = "虚拟显示器的分辨率。分辨率越高，占用带宽越多。";
"Doubles pixel density. Sharper text but uses more bandwidth." = "使像素密度翻倍。文字更清晰，但占用更多带宽。";
"Adjusts the brightness of your built-in display." = "调节内建显示器的亮度。";
"Streams system audio to the receiver. Requires a compatible receiver." = "将系统音频串流到接收端。需要兼容的接收端。";
"Uses legacy display capture to bypass DRM/HDCP blocking (Netflix, Apple TV). May use more CPU and disables audio streaming. Only works when mirroring a physical display." = "使用旧式显示器捕获以绕过 DRM/HDCP 限制（Netflix、Apple TV）。可能占用更多 CPU 并停用音频串流。仅在镜像物理显示器时可用。";
"Automatically connect to discovered receivers when they appear on the network." = "当发现的接收端出现在网络中时自动连接。";
"Auto: AWDL for Apple devices, WiFi for others. P2P: forces direct link. Router: uses your WiFi network. Cable: USB/Thunderbolt only." = "自动：Apple 设备使用 AWDL，其他设备使用 WiFi。P2P：强制直连。路由器：使用你的 WiFi 网络。线缆：仅限 USB/雷雳。";
"TCP is reliable and works everywhere. UDP has lower latency but only works over P2P/AWDL." = "TCP 可靠且适用于所有环境。UDP 延迟更低，但仅适用于 P2P/AWDL。";
"Higher quality uses more bandwidth. Use Low/Medium on WiFi, High/Ultra on P2P or cable." = "质量越高，占用带宽越多。WiFi 下建议使用低/中，P2P 或线缆连接下建议使用高/超高。";
"Auto picks the best rate per connection (60). 30 saves bandwidth and battery. 120 is experimental for high-refresh receivers; needs a strong link and doubles bandwidth. Hit Apply Settings (or reconnect) to take effect." = "自动会为每个连接选择最佳帧率 (60)。30 可节省带宽和电量。120 为实验性功能，适用于高刷新率接收端；需要稳定的连接且带宽翻倍。点按\"应用设置\"（或重新连接）后生效。";
"Streams system audio to this receiver." = "将系统音频串流到此接收端。";
"Switches to a wireless ADB tunnel so you can unplug the cable. Stays connected through the handoff." = "切换到无线 ADB 隧道，之后即可拔掉线缆。切换过程中保持连接不中断。";
"Plug in a USB cable first. USB gives lower latency and higher bandwidth than WiFi." = "请先插入 USB 线缆。USB 比 WiFi 延迟更低、带宽更高。";
"Streams via USB using Android Debug Bridge. Highest quality with no network needed. Plug in your Android device first." = "通过 USB 使用 Android 调试桥 (ADB) 串流。质量最高且无需网络。请先插入你的 Android 设备。";
"Wireless ADB tunnel. Connect USB once to pair, then unplug and stream wirelessly at full quality." = "无线 ADB 隧道。先通过 USB 连接一次以配对，之后即可拔线并以全画质无线串流。";
"Connects directly over WiFi without ADB. Lower FPS but no USB setup required." = "无需 ADB，直接通过 WiFi 连接。FPS 较低，但无需 USB 设置。";
"Connects over your local network. Apple devices use AWDL peer-to-peer when available for best performance." = "通过本地网络连接。Apple 设备在可用时会使用 AWDL 点对点连接以获得最佳性能。";

